vents", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "74541180747f56051e20e6c7679844d30ab7e4cc", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kn-mirror/serving/commits/74541180747f56051e20e6c7679844d30ab7e4cc", "html_url": "https://github.com/kn-mirror/serving/commit/74541180747f56051e20e6c7679844d30ab7e4cc"}]}, {"sha": "989918a189a0c076fa7a35b35ef7d27c4fa26dba", "node_id": "MDY6Q29tbWl0Mjc4ODgzNDI5Ojk4OTkxOGExODlhMGMwNzZmYTdhMzViMzVlZjdkMjdjNGZhMjZkYmE=", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Victor Agababov", "email": "vagababov@gmail.com", "date": "2020-01-30T04:23:27Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2020-01-30T04:23:27Z"}, "message": "Add activator DaemonSet (#6624)\n\n* Add activator DaemonSet\n\nThis change switches activator to be run as a daemon set.\nThe changes:\n- add daemon set\n- run with smaller footprint\n- reduce regular HPA to maxSize=1. This permits user to change the value, should the need arive, but will keep the default to a single instance.\n- also reduce its footprint, to match the DS ones.\n\nFor #6550\n\n* licence + remove duplicate\n\n* remove the test patch, since we no longer need it\n\n* make sure the activator DS is in core and aliased\n\n* TEST\n\n* test\n\n* test2\n\n* fix hpa", "tree": {"sha": "2980c141efd46cce067dfb80d71f4f999201554b", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kn-mirror/serving/git/trees/2980c141efd46cce067dfb80d71f4f999201554b"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kn-mirror/serving/git/commits/989918a189a0c076fa7a35b35ef7d27c4fa26dba", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJeMlo/CRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAdHIIACbzfbiwbjEPAkJf4gt3cy5g\naFqrSm8yvylMrHyw/e5KT+t+t/i2AJA4K6qguvkIk26tPVre9l3o+B3cHoYlJskc\nHWD5sxviuPKccFXJ33GpvGtpNCxPPA9srQ4UDcBhONT37IGNwbmGWiypHblYv9KN\n5BK0HItYn2jx23QO0BWiZ0fbQlkGF+Nelgin9/VQgLrG+BynAalBduOBz6ftS5T1\nEuYDxNJ0vqoQ6GPF8wERjUZhefM5rUs1sKFb/TSKSmRurF1nzX1qgHcmZLxye+7b\nsVZGLZRqOYnK/9S/Q0O6XW10I5ZSEn+XS08smZjZdG6/RuImof9b5VRs3wBzinY=\n=zVtg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 2980c141efd46cce067dfb80d71f4f999201554b\nparent 90294b5e48c41b83381d4a9d58865201fb95e38c\nauthor Victor Agababov <vagababov@gmail.com> 1580358207 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1580358207 -0800\n\nAdd activator DaemonSet (#6624)\n\n* Add activator DaemonSet\n\nThis change switches activator to be run as a daemon set.\nThe changes:\n- add daemon set\n- run with smaller footprint\n- reduce regular HPA to maxSize=1. This permits user to change the value, should the need arive, but will keep the default to a single instance.\n- also reduce its footprint, to match the DS ones.\n\nFor #6550\n\n* licence + remove duplicate\n\n* remove the test patch, since we no longer need it\n\n* make sure the activator DS is in core and aliased\n\n* TEST\n\n* test\n\n* test2\n\n* fix hpa\n", "verified_at": "2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kn-mirror/serving/commits/989918a189a0c076fa7a35b35ef7d27c4fa26dba", "html_url": "https://github.com/kn-mirror/serving/commit/989918a189a0c076fa7a35b35ef7d27c4fa26dba", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kn-mirror/serving/commits/989918a189a0c076fa7a35b35ef7d27c4fa26dba/comments", "author": {"login": "vagababov", "id": 764767, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDc2Nw==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/764767?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/vagababov", "html_url": "https://github.com/vagababov", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vagababov/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vagababov/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vagababov/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vagababov/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vagababov/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github